OL,3,GNEWSAThousands use new designated
OL,4,Acamper van spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchemes to allow campervans and
OL,7,Fmotorhomes to park overnight in car
OL,8,Fparks in holiday spots have been a
OL,9,Fsuccess, two local authorities have
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThere have been around 1,000 overnight
OL,13,Fstays since April across the 11 car
OL,14,Fparks in Cornwall where camping is now
OL,15,Fpermitted, while East Devon has
OL,16,Frecorded more than 2,600 stays in the
OL,17,F10 months to 1 September.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
