OL,3,GNEWSAThousands use new designated
OL,4,Acamper van spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Devon councillor Sam Hawkins said
OL,7,Fproviding official overnight spaces in
OL,8,Ftwo car parks in Exmouth had been a
OL,9,F"boon for the town" and helped reduce
OL,10,Fantisocial behaviour, including
OL,11,Funauthorised overnight parking.
OL,13,FCamper Chris Cadby welcomed the new
OL,14,Fstopover schemes, and said: "There are
OL,15,Fvery few places where you can just rock
OL,16,Fup and park."
